<BaseLayout title="Jesse Wunderlich :: HOME">
  <div class="box">
    <h2>&gt; welcome.txt</h2>
    <p class="lead">Hey, I'm Jesse. Oldest of seven, Marine turned drone operator, and I've
    started more businesses than I can count on two hands. These days I fly the ScanEagle for a
    living and build software the rest of the time.</p>
    <p>This is my workshop wall — pinned with what I'm making, breaking, and learning. No algorithm,
    no tracking, no newsletter pop-up. Just a hand-coded corner of the web the way they used to be.</p>
    <p style="font-size:.85rem;">Poke around: <a href="/about/">who I am</a> &middot;
      <a href="/now/">what I'm up to now</a> &middot;
      <a href="/projects/">what I'm building</a> &middot;
      <a href="/guestbook/">sign the guestbook</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <h2>&gt; the short version</h2>
    <ul class="now">
      <li>🦅 USMC Sergeant (ret), 2013–2018 — Service-Disabled Veteran</li>
      <li>🛩️ UAS operator flying the ScanEagle, deployed ~6–8 months/year</li>
      <li>💻 Building <b>Nova</b>, an AI-first net worth tracker</li>
      <li>🏠 Lake country, Minnesota — wife Charlotte, son Dewey, a daughter on the way, three Cane Corsos</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
